constraints:
1 <= n <= 10^{4}

expected time complexity: O(log_{2} N * log_{5} N).
expected auxiliary space: O(1).

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def findNum(self, n: int):
		count = 0
		num = 5
		while True:
			temp = num
			while temp % 5 == 0:
				count += 1
				temp //= 5
			if count >= n:
				return num
			num += 5
